you progress in Fates Call story.<br><br><strong>Parry their attacks and find an opening to cut them to pieces ! </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Fight.gif?t=1610999781\" /></div><br><br><strong>Annihilate them with powerful spells </strong> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Spell.gif?t=1610999781\" /></div><br><br><strong>Or follow the path of the ranger, and fill your enemies with arrows </strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Bow.gif?t=1610999781\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Title_01.png?t=1610999781\" /></div><br><br>You'll meet several companions, each of them has unique gameplay and will help you during your journey ! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Compan.png?t=1610999781\" /></div><br><br>Compatible Headset &amp; Controllers : Vive, Index, Oculus, Window Mixed Reality<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691090/extras/Hnet-image.gif?t=1610999781\" /></div>",
